dsh-continue-all README · Use：Only sessions interrupted in the last 6 hours are selected by default. Older interrupted sessions are listed behind an opt-in checkbox, so a batch cannot reach sessions from earlier crashes or abandoned work by accident.

Sessions are left out when they are:

- running (their turn is live work, not an interrupted one);
- blank, a subagent, or archived;
- waiting for an approval or an answer.

Archived sessions stay archived. Unarchive one first if it should be continued.
